# Grounding

The tables above are the metadata of this session: you have seen them. For a category column, take the filter values from its sample values, with the same spelling and case. When the value that the user wants is not in the samples, use the format of the samples. When several columns could match a word of the user, choose by their descriptions, not by their names only.

