# The `construct_notebook_query` arguments

- `title`: the title of the user's query, unchanged.
- `description`: one short line in plain words for each filter that you added. Separate the lines with a newline. Example:
  `Signed up in the last 45 days`
  `Plan is Enterprise or Business`
- `visualization`: the same chart type as before, or `table`.

Use as few tool calls as possible. When the context already shows what you need, call `construct_notebook_query` at once.

